496683402", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411996_673505500016735_2170965674423752804_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FU9zHYcJD5kQ7kNvwG0QRZv&_nc_oc=AdrG4-hWO0wHsZNJE55F8lplM8AAqKt2dmkbvK_uWXv4HCrxU_NoZ37wyfRfXbHjbQQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-dMe1xII76vyC3XhElMdyPoqgQGrrPHg-bwtDL8wiV3g&oe=6A3D306B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vr battle of battleship logo 2560 x 1440 210408 0.png", "id": "187457906371403", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75324644_187457909704736_8884903440668078259_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=apuiGvzJ-UwQ7kNvwFtRX1N&_nc_oc=AdohqUixevxwc9BLBbD85m2sDR29vLPpCRQVOXaQGswbG2E_JsF14vHUMVFqpoXmPi4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_YJMTCUjb7mOMgerV5vjQLwORtGZ5Afmyaznc5JD7mMA&oe=6A3D4C71"}, "display_name": "VR Battle of Battleship", "keywords": [], "long_description": "1. Basic Operation:\n- You can start the battle by firing the main guns of the battleship.\n- The following modern weapons are added to increase the tension of the game:\n    - Your battleship has CIWS Beam for defense\n    - Enemy battleship has Anti-ship missiles\n\n2. The Physical Law Modification:\nTo realize the short-time and amazing spectacle battle of huge battleships, some of the physical laws in this Real-Time Simulation World are carefully modified.\n\n3. Conclusion:\nWe believe that the amazing spectacle battle of the huge battleship in VR world is established by the\nunique modification of the physical laws in this application.\nPlease enjoy this VR real-time simulation of battle of battleship.\n\nNull City Realtime Simulation, Development Team", "short_description": "\u201cVR Battle of Battleship\u201d is a Real-Time Simulation Game of the one-on-one fight of the Ultimate Huge Battleships; IOWA-class and Yamato-class in VR world.\nFrom the beginning of this application, yo